        "original_id": "9027e62a-0957-5405-88ea-dc0c1cbfb362",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Publications: Guitar World, Golf Digest\n- Companies: Condé Nast Publications, The New York Times Company\n- People: Daron Malakian, Serj Tankian, Shavo Odadjian, John Dolmayan\n- Organizations: System of a Down\n- Places: United States, Des Moines, Iowa\n- Topics: guitarists, golf, heavy metal guitarists\n\nFacts:\n- Golf Digest started in 1950.\n- Golf Digest was sold to The New York Times Company in 1969.\n- Guitar World has been published since July 1980.\n- System of a Down was formed in the mid-1990s by Serj Tankian, Daron Malakian, Shavo Odadjian, and John Dolmayan, who are musicians of Armenian origin.\n- Guitar World is a monthly music magazine devoted to guitarists.\n- Golf Digest is a monthly golf magazine published by Condé Nast Publications in the United States.\n- Golf Digest is headquartered in Des Moines, Iowa.\n- Daron Malakian is ranked 30th in Guitar World's list The 100 Greatest Heavy Metal Guitarists of All Time.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
